---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /e-visits/
title: Online E-Visits
description: Care for select conditions without a scheduled video appointment. Complete a secure questionnaire and your provider will review it.
---
{% from "macros/icon.njk" import icon %}
{#
  HIPAA BOUNDARY — do not add a questionnaire to this page.

  The e-visit questionnaire collects symptoms and medical history, which is
  PHI. It lives inside SimplePractice under their BAA. This page describes
  the service and links out. Adding any symptom, condition, or history field
  here would pull the practice into HIPAA scope and require compliant
  hosting, a BAA with the host, audit logging, and breach procedures.
#}
<main id="main">
  <header class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Online E-Visits</div>
      <h1>Care without a scheduled <em>appointment</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        For select conditions, you may be able to receive care without a scheduled
        video visit — on your time, without sitting in a waiting room.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  {% include "partials/wave-divider.njk" %}

  <section class="category-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="category-intro">
        Complete a secure online questionnaire about your symptoms and medical
        history. Your provider will review the information and determine whether
        your concern can be safely treated through an e-visit.
      </div>

      <div class="group-grid">
        <article class="group-card">
          <h3>{{ icon("clipboard-list", icons, 22, 1.6) }}How it works</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Start your e-visit in our secure patient portal</li>
            <li>Answer questions about your symptoms and history</li>
            <li>Your provider reviews during office hours</li>
            <li>You receive a plan, or a recommendation for the right next step</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="group-card">
          <h3>{{ icon("check", icons, 22, 1.6) }}Good fit for</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Select uncomplicated, straightforward concerns</li>
            <li>Situations that don't need real-time conversation</li>
            <li>Follow-up questions on an established plan</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="group-card">
          <h3>{{ icon("video", icons, 22, 1.6) }}Choose a video visit instead for</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>New concerns that benefit from discussion</li>
            <li>Chronic condition follow-up</li>
            <li>Anything needing visual assessment</li>
            <li>Preventive and wellness care</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="clinical-note">
        <strong>Important</strong>
        E-visits are available for select uncomplicated concerns. Submission of a
        questionnaire does not guarantee treatment, a diagnosis, or a prescription.
        A prescription is provided only when medically appropriate. Some conditions
        require a video visit, an in-person examination, testing, or a higher level
        of care. Controlled substances are not prescribed.
      </div>

      <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:40px">
        {% if site.booking.evisitUrl %}
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.booking.evisitUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start an E-Visit</a>
        {% else %}
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" data-open-booking>Ask About E-Visits</button>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bottom-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="emergency-banner">
        <strong>Medical emergency</strong>
        If you are experiencing a medical emergency or potentially life-threatening
        symptoms, call 911 or go to the nearest emergency department. Do not use the
        website, patient portal, messaging system, or an online visit to seek
        emergency care.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
